      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that. but what about the parents who feel like this stuff is too complex for a 7 year old and that we're pushing adult ideas onto them too early? if they want to just stick to basics and not bring up non-binary stuff at all until they're older, is that considered bad parenting or just a different choice?",
